s", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 17534, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_015QA7FqwGwHRWTZ5Ggsx495", "tool": "create_incident", "args": {"title": "checkout-api failing health checks after v2.3.1 deploy; rolled back to v2.3.0", "severity": "SEV2", "service": "checkout-api", "summary": "checkout-api began failing health checks after the v2.3.1 production deploy (error rate 0.18). Actions taken: (1) Identified v2.3.0 as the most recent production release that was healthy; v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy and v2.3.1-rc was only in staging. (2) Rolled back checkout-api to v2.3.0. The first rollback attempt failed partway through with a partial_failure (orchestrator error) after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west v2.3.1). (3) Retried the rollback to v2.3.0, which completed in all regions (us-east, us-west, eu-west). Post-rollback status: healthy, error rate 0.002. No change-manager approval was needed since v2.3.0 was previously healthy in production. Follow-ups: investigate the v2.3.1 failure cause, and the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt."}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 48134, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_015QA7FqwGwHRWTZ5Ggsx495", "tool": "create_incident", "state": "EXECUTION_UNKNOWN", "error_kind": "timeout", "error_message": "Request to create_incident timed out after 30000ms", "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": "execution", "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 48134, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_015QA7FqwGwHRWTZ5Ggsx495", "kind": "error", "is_error": true}, {"t_ms": 49295, "event": "agent_call", "actor": "agent", "call_id": "toolu_01TrPpcVjUZM6RKWZqBJ8VY9", "tool": "list_incidents", "args": {}, "confidence": null}, {"t_ms": 49595, "event": "runtime_outcome", "actor": "runtime", "call_id": "toolu_01TrPpcVjUZM6RKWZqBJ8VY9", "tool": "list_incidents", "state": "EXECUTED", "error_kind": null, "error_message": null, "attempts": 1, "runtime_actions": [], "failure_class": null, "idempotency_key": null, "malformed": false}, {"t_ms": 49595, "event": "agent_result", "actor": "control_plane", "call_id": "toolu_01TrPpcVjUZM6RKWZqBJ8VY9", "kind": "ok", "is_error": false}, {"t_ms": 51706, "event": "episode_end", "actor": "harness", "termination": "final", "final": "checkout-api is rolled back to v2.3.0 in all three regions and is healthy again (error rate 0.002, down from 0.18). The SEV2 incident is open as INC-0001.\n\n- **Rollback target:** v2.3.0 was the most recent release that was healthy in production. v2.3.1 is marked unhealthy, and v2.3.1-rc only ran in staging. Because v2.3.0 had already been healthy in production, no change-manager approval was needed.\n- **Rollback issue:** The first rollback attempt failed partway through with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open, so I did not create a duplicate. Its summary covers the timeline above and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call engineer: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and find the cause of the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt.", "error": null}], "transcript": [{"stop_reason": "tool_use", "content": [{"signature": "", "thinking": "", "type": "thinking"}, {"id": "toolu_01SbwicqRUwSvME6CME2FpZ5", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "list_deployments", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}, {"id": "toolu_01Q1oCc2vW36pFUZ1kw2WLgn", "caller": {"type": "direct"}, "input": {"service": "checkout-api"}, "name": "get_service_status", "type": "tool_use", "toolset_name": null}]}, {"stop_reason": "tool_use", "conten