ck attempt failed partway through with an orchestrator error after us-east, leaving the fleet mixed (us-east on v2.3.0, us-west and eu-west still on v2.3.1). I retried the same rollback once and it completed in all regions.\n- **Incident:** The first attempt to create the incident timed out. I checked the incident list before retrying and found INC-0001 already open, so I did not create a duplicate. Its summary covers the timeline above and the follow-ups.\n\nFollow-ups for the on-call engineer: find out why v2.3.1 failed health checks, and find the cause of the orchestrator error that halted the first rollback attempt.", "type": "text"}]}]}